    "The identity terms expose omitted phase action and cancellation. Their norm magnitudes are not additive causal percentages or perturbative eigenvalue-error explanations.",
    "Recommendation: retire the universal top-curvature-plus-isotropic-bulk leading-pair explanation for this panel. Do not search ranks or refit coefficients to turn this consumed panel into a positive result."
